# Rust build output
rust/target/
rust/Cargo.lock
**/*.rs.bk

# Cross-compiled native libraries (cargo-ndk output, one .so per ABI — ~150-200MB each as debug
# builds, still tens of MB even in release). Built by a CI/build step from the Rust crate above,
# never hand-edited, so there's nothing to gain from committing them and a lot of repo bloat to
# lose — same reasoning as rust/target/ above, just for the cross-compiled artifacts specifically.
android/src/main/jniLibs/
ios/**/*.a

